        # CEILING the ToneCurve docstring imposes. The measured shoulders want
        # to be SOFTER than that; 1.4x is the monotonicity-safe bound this
        # project holds new stocks to, so the fit is clamped there and the real
        # shoulder is very slightly sharper in the model than on the plate.
        # WHAT THE TRACE CHANGED, AND WHAT IT CONFIRMED:
        #   * dmin becomes the ORANGE-MASK LADDER 0.187 / 0.526 / 0.876. The
        #     old triple was 0.22 / 0.20 / 0.19 -- flat, i.e. the WRONG KIND of
        #     description for a masked colour negative, the same defect the
        #     2026-08-26 KODAK still-film batch found on eight profiles. This
