        # ⚠ THE PAPER VALIDATES THIS SET FROM OUTSIDE, which is why it is adopted:
        #      traced   1.462 D @ 445.9 nm   printed  1.46 @ 448   (yellow)
        #      traced   1.474 D @ 522.1 nm   printed  1.48 @ 525   (magenta)
        #      traced   1.459 D @ 683.1 nm   printed  1.46 @ 687   (cyan)
        #   and the figure's own C / M / Y letters sit at 448 / 528 / 683 nm, one
        #   above each traced peak. Layer names come from those peaks, never from
