        # lower-tier data in preference to no data.
        # CONVERSION, stated so it can be undone:
        #   gain_r  = their halation.intensity, verbatim, unscaled;
        #   gain_g = gain_r (silver scatter is neutral; their tint for
        #     B&W stocks is the flat (1,1,1) display convenience, so it
        #     carries no information);
        #   gain_b = 0.75 * gain_r, from THIS PROJECT'S existing B&W
        #     convention (ILFORD_FP4 0.04/0.04/0.03, ILFORD_HP4
        #     0.05/0.05/0.04), not from the third party;
