        #     1.7 finest). The colour-stock regression above was fitted on
        #     colour negatives only and is not applicable here. Ordering is
        #     theirs, absolute scale is ours.
        # NOT IMPORTED: their halation.radius_norm is a fraction of the
        # IMAGE DIMENSION, not micrometres, and no non-circular conversion
        # to radii_um exists (any calibration would be fitted against this
