    # ---- 2026-08-18: PLACEHOLDER-SOURCE CLOSURE ---------------------------
    # Six profiles claimed tier 1 or 2 from their [T*] description tag while
    # `_provenance_for` fell back to `_NO_DATASHEET` for them, so the queryable
