    # STATEMENTS ARE NOW OUT OF DATE, 2026-08-24: 8530 carries three citations
    # (Honjo 1989 plus the two «Техника кино и телевидения» issues) and 8630
    # no longer exists -- it was a gauge clone and was removed.
