        "⚠ FIGURE-BY-FIGURE STATE AFTER THE 2026-08-19 PASS (queue item G3): "
        "Fig. 10 (sensitometric curves, printed p652) MACHINE-TRACED and adopted at "
        "one sample per pixel column -- 589/513/437 samples for B/G/R, ToneCurve "
