        "interpolated set; queue G7. "
        "PRINTED AND STILL UNSTORED for want of a carrier: the exposure convention "
        "'1076 lx (100 ft/cd) ... f/2.8 ... 1/50 s', storage 'below 12 C (54 F)', "
